From: CMGS <ilskdw@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 18:59:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] vmm: Add a reader for /proc/self/pagemap

PageMap finds the pages of a private file mapping that are private
copies: present or swapped pages without the file bit. It returns them
as byte ranges, and it merges two ranges when 8 pages or less separate
them, which keeps the number of ranges low. A later commit uses it to
find the guest pages that changed after a copy-on-write restore.

Signed-off-by: CMGS <ilskdw@gmail.com>
